      "message": "feat(ui,app): wire browser app tracing, dropped model bytes, and inline CpuEye fallback\n\nRoute camcraft_app tracing through a browser-safe subscriber without\ntimestamps or ANSI escapes, and initialize it in camcraft_start. Support\nbare-name dropped model bytes in file_drop::take_drop using existing\nMESH_EXTENSIONS, too_big, and file_pick::deliver checks. Add\nCpuEye::inline and frame repaint polling while inline stock marching is\npending.\n\nRefs #31",
